[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673123694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-2673123694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":2673123694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fVKFu","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T01:24:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T01:26:32Z","body":"GDScript version:\n```gdscript\nextends Tree\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar root := create_item()\n\troot.set_text(0, \"Root\")\n\tfor i in 2:\n\t\tvar item := create_item(root)\n\t\titem.set_text(0, \"Child %s\" % [i])\n\t\n\titem_selected.connect(_on_item_selected)\n\nfunc _on_item_selected() -> void:\n\tvar selected := get_selected()\n\tvar item := create_item(selected)\n\titem.set_text(0, \"Another Child\")\n```\n\nIt results in the same issue (`Cannot call method 'set_text' on a null value.`), so this is not C#/dotnet specific issue. Happens because `create_item(selected)` fails as the Tree is in a blocked state.\n\nFrom `Debugger` -> `Errors` tab, v4.4.beta4.official [93d270693]:\n```\nE 0:00:14:174   tree.tscn::GDScript_xvyuw:14 @ _on_item_selected(): Condition \"blocked > 0\" is true. Returning: nullptr\n  <C++ Source>  scene/gui/tree.cpp:4509 @ create_item()\n  <Stack Trace> tree.tscn::GDScript_xvyuw:14 @ _on_item_selected()\n```\n\nIndeed creating items seems to be not allowed when selecting with mouse:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/93d270693079ea7802c9e1334a2e0ecd8529eeed/scene/gui/tree.cpp#L3875-L3877\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/93d270693079ea7802c9e1334a2e0ecd8529eeed/scene/gui/tree.cpp#L4508-L4509\n\nSo this looks like not a bug, and instead needs to be properly documented. `Tree.create_item` needs to mention it can fail and return `null` (and possibly when).\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/93d270693079ea7802c9e1334a2e0ecd8529eeed/doc/classes/Tree.xml#L45-L53\n\n---\n\nAs a workaround you can connect with [`CONNECT_DEFERRED`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.3/classes/class_object.html#class-object-constant-connect-deferred) flag, so the connected method won't be instantly called on the signal emission.\n```gdscript\nitem_selected.connect(_on_item_selected, CONNECT_DEFERRED)\n```\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f89661d6-4944-4250-b360-5a340e54db68)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673123694/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674662041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-2674662041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":2674662041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fbBqZ","user":{"login":"dsobiera","id":12647891,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjQ3ODkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12647891?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera","html_url":"https://github.com/dsobiera","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsobiera/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T14:13:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T14:13:43Z","body":"That worked quite nicely (setting the signal to deferred). Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2674662041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791444583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-2791444583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":2791444583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mYhBn","user":{"login":"Kv-Lam","id":138936765,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEgBvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138936765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam","html_url":"https://github.com/Kv-Lam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kv-Lam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T03:17:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T03:17:48Z","body":"Hello, I am interested in contributing to Godot for the first time. However, due to being new, I lack experience with the proper Godot workflow and code standards. As such, I hope to start my learning by properly documenting this for the ``Tree.create_item`` method if no one else has done so. As the issue is still open and the official documentation does not include the related information, I assume it is free to do so!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791444583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842087356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-2842087356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":2842087356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pZs-8","user":{"login":"Tempstarwolf","id":178960514,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqq4gg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178960514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf","html_url":"https://github.com/Tempstarwolf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tempstarwolf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T13:59:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T13:59:42Z","body":"\nyou could add somthing like this.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTreeItem *Tree::create_item(TreeItem *p_parent, int p_index) {\n\tERR_FAIL_COND_V(blocked > 0, nullptr);\n\n\tTreeItem *ti = nullptr;\n\n       if (p_parent && !p_parent->is_visible_in_tree())\n      {\n\tERR_PRINT(\"Cannot create TreeItem: parent is not visible in the tree. You may be modifying the tree during a signal callback. Consider using CallDeferred().\");\n\treturn nullptr;\n      }\n\n\tif (p_parent) {\n\t\tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(p_parent->tree != this, nullptr, \"A different tree owns the given parent\");\n\t\tti = p_parent->create_child(p_index);\n\t} else {\n\t\tif (!root) {\n\t\t\t// No root exists, make the given item the new root.\n\t\t\tti = memnew(TreeItem(this));\n\t\t\tERR_FAIL_NULL_V(ti, nullptr);\n\t\t\tti->cells.resize(columns.size());\n\t\t\tti->is_root = true;\n\t\t\troot = ti;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\t// Root exists, append or insert to root.\n\t\t\tti = create_item(root, p_index);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t_determine_hovered_item();\n\n\treturn ti;\n}","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842087356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077002316","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-3077002316","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":3077002316,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63Z1RM","user":{"login":"CastonYoung","id":14902072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTAyMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14902072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung","html_url":"https://github.com/CastonYoung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CastonYoung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T06:09:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T06:09:30Z","body":"According to kleonc, the line that reads `propagate_mouse_event(pos + theme_cache.offset, 0, 0, x_limit + theme_cache.offset.width, mb->is_double_click(), root, mb->get_button_index(), mb);` used to be at line, 3876, but now it is located at 4130.  That's over 250 lines of difference.  I wouldn't know if this is just because of a simple move or not (I tried to find out via GitHub, and the tab froze.  Somehow, even after all these years, git still finds new ways to fail me), but it seems to me that a whole lot might have changed in these past few months and what was previously stated may no longer be true.  \nI wanted to work on this issue as it appeared under the <good first issue> tag, but I feel like I'm going to need an update on what has been done before I can tackle this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077002316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3586295861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103101#issuecomment-3586295861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103101","id":3586295861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vwog1","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T14:53:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T14:53:12Z","body":"This issue will be closed by #113178 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3586295861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]